.TH HOWDY.INI 5 "@HOWDY_MAN_DATE@" "Howdy Next @PROJECT_VERSION@" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
howdy.ini \- Howdy Next configuration file
.SH DESCRIPTION
The file
.I @HOWDY_CONFIG_PATH_ROFF@
contains runtime configuration for Howdy Next.
.PP
The configuration file is formatted using standard INI syntax organized into section
headers followed by key and value definitions:
.PP
.nf
[section]
key = value
.fi
.PP
Lines beginning with
.B #
or
.B ;
are treated as comments.
.SH "CONFIGURATION OPTIONS"
@HOWDY_CONFIG_REFERENCE@
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @HOWDY_CONFIG_PATH_ROFF@
Main Howdy configuration file.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR howdy (1),
.BR pam_howdy (8)
